main:2: note:   -> returned by "second()" (tmp/util.py:5)
main:2: note:   -> assigned to "x" (tmp/util.py:5)
[out2]
main:2: note: Any comes from missing return annotation of "second" (tmp/util.py:3)
main:2: note:   -> returned by "second()" (tmp/util.py:5)
main:2: note:   -> assigned to "x" (tmp/util.py:5)

